   "tip": {
    "title": "Every day ends in -ବାର",
    "text": "ବାର (bara) means 'day of the week'. The days are named after the sun, moon and planets: ରବି sun, ସୋମ moon, ମଙ୍ଗଳ Mars, ବୁଧ Mercury, ଗୁରୁ Jupiter, ଶୁକ୍ର Venus, ଶନି Saturn. Learn the first part and just add -ବାର."
